{"id":"situacio_n","lemma":"situación","pos":"noun","rank":521,"glosses":["situation, scenario, picture","position (based on circumstance or the effect of another's actions)","status, state of affairs, condition"],"ipa":"/sitwaˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"situaciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f6/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-situaci%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Qué harías en esa situación?","en":"What would you do in that situation?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/589918","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"that","l":"ese"},null]},{"text":"La situación cambió el año siguiente.","en":"The situation changed the following year.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692447","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to change","l":"cambiar"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"year"},{"g":"following"}]},{"text":"¿Qué debería haber hecho en esa situación?","en":"What should I have done in that situation?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693261","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to have"},{"g":"done, completed"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"that","l":"ese"},null]},{"text":"¿Cuál es la peor situación posible?","en":"What's the worst case scenario?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804316","words":[{"g":"which one, what, which"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"bad","l":"malo"},null,{"g":"possible"}]},{"text":"Me siento incómodo en esa clase de situaciones.","en":"I feel uncomfortable in this kind of situation.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1156758","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to seat","l":"sentar"},{"g":"uncomfortable"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"that","l":"ese"},{"g":"lecture"},{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}